(c3)SUB[Under thy patronage we fly, ](e) tu(e)um(g') præ(h)sí(i')di(i)um(g') con(h)fú(ij)gi(j)mus,(i.) *(,) 
san[O holy Mother of God:](i)cta(i) De(h')i(f) Ge(h')ni(h)trix:(g.) (;) 
nos[reject not the prayers we send up to thee in our necessities,](e)tras(e) de(g')pre(h)ca(i')ti(h)ó(i_j)nes(i.) (,) 
ne(j) des(i)pí(hg)ci(f)as(g_h) in(ih~) ne(f)ces(g')si(f)tá(e)ti(de)bus,(e.) (:) 
sed[but ever deliver us in time of peril, ](ff) a(d) pe(f)rí(h')cu(g)lis(f) cun(hh)ctis(g.) (,) 
lí(i)be(i)ra(h') nos(h) sem(iji)per,(hg/hih.) (;) 
Vir[O Virgin glorious](f)go(e) glo(fh)ri(hi)ó(hg)sa(f_e) (,) et[and blessed.](f) be(f!gwh_f)ne(g_f)dic(e.)ta.(e.) (::)
